### 1. Create a new 1-1 conversation (utu)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Cookie: accessToken={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "utu",
    "member_ids": ["{{userId2}}"]
}

### 2. Create a new Group Chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Cookie: accessToken={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "group",
    "name": "Group of Eight Stories",
    "member_ids": ["{{userId2}}", "91823912-1231-4a11-babc-999999999999"]
}

### 3. Get information about a conversation by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{conversationId}}
Cookie: accessToken={{token}}
